[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="WeaponBase" load_steps=4 format=3]

; RPG (2H) — single-rocket AoE launcher. 1–2 round magazine forces
; reload between volleys. Alt-fire is the rpg_nuke.tres mini-nuke on a
; long cooldown — same magazine, so each nuke costs one of your rare
; rockets. Single-target DPS sits around the ~22 baseline; the AoE
; blast multiplies effective DPS in crowds, which is the whole point.

